{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23720","headline":"山石榴花十二韵 · 白居易","name":"山石榴花十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晔晔复煌煌，花中无比方。\n艳夭宜小院，条短称低廊。\n本是山头物，今爲砌下芳。\n千丛相向背，万朵互低昂。\n照灼连朱槛，玲珑暎粉墙。\n风来添意态，日出助晶光。\n渐绽臙脂萼，犹含琴轸房。\n离披乱剪彩，斑駮未匀妆。\n绦焰灯千炷，红裙妓一行。\n此时逢国色，何处觅天香？\n恐合栽金阙，思将献玉皇。\n好差青鸟使，封作百花王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}